              "text": "¡Qué bueno!",
              "english": "(Message) How nice!"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "karla",
              "text": "Hay café para todos.",
              "english": "There is coffee for everyone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Ahora el pastor escribe un aviso para los vecinos.",
              "english": "Now the pastor writes a notice for the neighbours."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "pastor",
              "text": "Reunión de vecinos.",
              "english": "(Notice) Neighbours' meeting."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "pastor",
              "text": "Fecha: el 14.",
              "english": "(Notice) Date: the 14th."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "pastor",
              "text": "Hora: las tres.",
              "english": "Time: three o'clock."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "pastor",
              "text": "En la iglesia.",
              "english": "At the church."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "pastor",
              "text": "Favor venir.",
              "english": "Please come."
            },
            {
              "text": "Está en la calle y en la tienda.",
              "english": "It is in the street and at the shop."
            },
            {
              "text": "Los vecinos hablan de la reunión.",
              "english": "The neighbours talk about the meeting."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "sam",
              "text": "¿La fecha es el 14?",
              "english": "Is the date the 14th?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "ana",
              "text": "Sí, la fecha es el 14.",
              "english": "Yes, the date is the 14th."
            },
            {
              "text": "En la terminal hay un aviso para el autobús.",
              "english": "At the terminal there is a notice about the bus."
            },
            {
              "text": "Dice: Favor esperar aquí.",
              "english": "It says: Please wait here."
            },
            {
              "text": "Favor no perder el boleto.",
              "english": "Please do not lose the ticket."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "daniel",
              "text": "¿Qué dice?",
              "english": "What does it say?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "sam",
              "text": "Dice: favor esperar aquí.",
              "english": "It says: please wait here."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "sam",
              "text": "Y favor no perder el boleto.",
              "english": "And please do not lose the ticket."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "daniel",
              "text": "No quiero perder mi boleto.",
              "english": "I do not want to lose my ticket."
            },
            {
              "text": "En la pulpería de la señora Elena hay un aviso.",
              "english": "In señora Elena's shop there is a notice."
            },
            {
              "text": "Dice: Hoy hay pollo y plátanos.",
              "english": "It says: Today there is chicken and plantains."
            },
            {
              "text": "Favor pagar aquí.",
              "english": "Please pay here."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "karla",
              "text": "¡Qué bueno!",
              "english": "How nice!"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "karla",
              "text": "Tengo hambre.",
              "english": "I am hungry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "speaker": "ana",
              "text": "Esta semana tengo mucho trabajo.",
